{"manifest":{"schema":1,"id":"com.idj.ext.hqporner","name":"HQPorner","version":"1.0.0","author":{"name":"CatVod 蜘蛛改写"},"description":"HQPorner（hqporner.com）。64 个分类 + 最新 / 热门 / 月榜 / 周榜 / 女优，详情嵌 mydaddy.cc 取最高画质 mp4。由 CatVod 蜘蛛 v1.0.1 改写。","type":"video","adult":true,"language":["zh"],"minAppVersion":"1.5","entry":"main.js","permissions":{"http":["hqporner.com","www.hqporner.com","*.hqporner.com","mydaddy.cc","*.mydaddy.cc"],"media":["bigcdn.cc","*.bigcdn.cc","fastporndelivery.hqporner.com","*.hqporner.com","mydaddy.cc"],"cloudflare":false,"storage":false,"login":false},"capabilities":["home","category","search","detail","play"],"settings":[],"update":{"url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/hoyittvggfh45/moytv/plugins/hqporner/hqporner.idjplugin"},"integrity":"sha256-hO5McA2n6KimJWW19laxeK54UciNnk8cuLHsKKmh/pw="},"files":{"main.js":"// HQPorner — idj1 插件（由 CatVod 蜘蛛 hqporner v1.0.1 改写）\n// 站点：https://hqporner.com；纯 HTML 正则抓取，无加密；详情页嵌 mydaddy.cc\n// 播放页，play() 抓该页取最高画质 mp4 直链。\n//\n// 相对原蜘蛛丢掉 / 降级的能力：\n// - 女优分类原来是 CatVod 的 vod_tag:\"folder\" 文件夹语义，idj 契约里没有文件夹\n//   原语——改成：分类里的女优点开后进详情页，详情页只有一条线路「该女优作品」\n//   （分集就是该女优的作品，点分集直接播）；女优页只取第 1 页作品，不翻页。\n// - link() 女优 / 分类跳转是 CatVod 语义，丢掉；女优名与分类名只留在详情简介\n//   与标签里。\n// - play() 多一层：女优作品分集的 id 是视频页 id（hdporn/xxx.html），先抓详情\n//   页拿 mydaddy 嵌页地址，再抓嵌页取 mp4；正片分集的 id 本来就是 play/<嵌页地址>。\n\nconst SITE = \"https://hqporner.com\";\nconst UA = \"Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/120.0.0.0 Safari/537.36\";\nconst TIMEOUT = 20000;\nconst PAGE_SIZE = 50;\n\n// 64 个分类，取自 https://hqporner.com/categories\nconst CATEGORIES = [\n    [\"1080p-porn\", \"1080p porn\"], [\"4k-porn\", \"4k porn\"], [\"60fps-porn\", \"60fps\"],\n    [\"amateur\", \"amateur\"], [\"anal-sex-hd\", \"anal\"], [\"asian\", \"asian\"],\n    [\"babe\", \"babe\"], [\"bdsm\", \"bdsm\"], [\"beach-porn\", \"beach\"],\n    [\"big-ass\", \"big ass\"], [\"big-dick\", \"big dick\"], [\"big-tits\", \"big tits\"],\n    [\"bise